            <title>[LUDOC-580] Add the ptlrpc tbf_jobid_cache_size parameter to LOM</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LUDOC-580</link>
                <project id="10070" key="LUDOC">Lustre Documentation</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The ptlrpc module parameter tbf_jobid_cache_size sets the maximum number of unused TBF classes in the LRU cache. &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19597" title="TBF: remove duplicate codes" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-19597"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-19597&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; changed how the cache shrinks and the scope of the limit. The Lustre Operations Manual must document the parameter, its default and the changed behavior.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
